Description: music player with Cover Flow, podcasts and internet radio
 BeatBox is a music player for GTK: a library with smart playlists,
 Cover Flow and an inline cover grid, synced lyrics, podcasts, internet
 radio, Last.fm and ListenBrainz scrobbling, and iPod sync.
